  {
   "id": "dojoran-139593@2.0.0.7",
   "gameId": "dojoran-139593",
   "displayName": "Update 2.0.0.7",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-12-08T13:20:15.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "This patch brings some of the latest major bug fixes found after patch 2.0.0.0. Most of them have been included previously without mention.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "List of changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Another increase in analogic deadzone.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Including an icon that shows you which option you are changing in the control menu (between gamepad and keyboard).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Now you are returned to stage selection after finishing the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved system of customized controls. It was possible to \"delete\" the selection button when placing a repeated command.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Small change in a part of jumping birds on the spikes, in stage 12.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Bug fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Removed an object that was not supposed to be on the HUD from the credit screen.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "SPOILER: Fixed the timing that the boss appeared on the right side of the screen. It was much faster than expected.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Correction in the objects position of Intro and Ending Game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug caused when pausing the game while losing the fly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the place where the game logo returned, after changing controls in the main menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Now the platforms that fall, really fall after being stepped very fast. This was a bug that became a feature, but we decided to fix it since it could hinder some speed runs.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug that the player was left without a selection button on the keyboard, if he had already installed the game before the 2.0.0.3 patch.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "If you find a bug, please mention it on the community page! Thank you for the reports!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "(Most of them for our excellent Game Tester hohoho)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Regards,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Mayha Murasaki",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
